# Expo public env vars (read at build/bundle time by Metro).
# Override the API server host when auto-detection isn't right for you.
# In Expo Go on your phone, the app auto-detects your PC's LAN IP from the
# dev-server URL, so you usually don't need this.
#
# Examples:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.50:4000
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://parkspot.example.com
#EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=